{"title":"Career Roadmap · Offshore Structural Engineer","role":"Offshore Structural Engineer","summary":"An Offshore Structural Engineer designs, analyzes, evaluates and maintains structures exposed to demanding marine environments.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Ocean Engineering"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Offshore Structural Engineer designs, analyzes, evaluates and maintains structures exposed to demanding marine environments."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Structural Engineering","Ocean Engineering","Hydrodynamics","Marine Materials","Geotechnical Engineering","Fatigue","Reliability","Offshore Construction"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical structures include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fixed offshore platforms"},{"text":"Jacket structures"},{"text":"Jack-up platforms"},{"text":"Floating production systems"},{"text":"Semi-submersibles"},{"text":"Spar platforms"},{"text":"Tension-leg platforms"},{"text":"Offshore substations"},{"text":"Floating wind platforms"},{"text":"Subsea support structures"},{"text":"Marine terminals"},{"text":"Offshore pipelines/support structures"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The engineer must account for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Waves"},{"text":"Currents"},{"text":"Wind"},{"text":"Tides"},{"text":"Corrosion"},{"text":"Fatigue"},{"text":"Seismic loading"},{"text":"Marine growth"},{"text":"Extreme storms"},{"text":"Foundation behaviour"},{"text":"Construction and installation loads"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Primary Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Tech/B.E. Ocean Engineering"},{"text":"Structural mechanics, fluid mechanics, ocean engineering, CAD/FEA"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Graduate/Junior Offshore Structural Engine