s"},{"text":"Concrete mattresses"},{"text":"Geotextile systems"},{"text":"Other project-specific protection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Finite Element Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"FEA is a major technical skill."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Element types"},{"text":"Nodes"},{"text":"Mesh"},{"text":"Boundary conditions"},{"text":"Loads"},{"text":"Material models"},{"text":"Convergence"},{"text":"Linear analysis"},{"text":"Nonlinear analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tools may include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ANSYS"},{"text":"Abaqus"},{"text":"SACS"},{"text":"SESAM"},{"text":"STAAD.Pro"},{"text":"SAP2000"},{"text":"OrcaFlex for coupled offshore analysis"},{"text":"The exact software stack varies considerably between employers."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Structural Modelling Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Geometry","Material","Sections","Connections","Boundary Conditions","Environmental Loads","Structural Analysis","Stress / Deflection","Buckling","Fatigue","Design Verification"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3–4 — Structural Dynamics"},{"type":"p","text":"Offshore structures experience dynamic loading."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Natural frequency"},{"text":"Mode shapes"},{"text":"Damping"},{"text":"Resonance"},{"text":"Harmonic response"},{"text":"Transient response"},{"text":"Spectral response"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Important for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Offshore platforms"},{"text":"Floating systems"},{"text":"Offshore wind turbines"},{"text":"Marine equipment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Offshore Wind Dynamics"},{"type":"p","text":"For offshore wind, understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Wind","Wave","Rotor","Tower","Foundation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"flow","items":["Wind","Rotor","Nacelle","Tower","Foundation","Seabed"]},{"type":"p","text":"The structure behaves as a coupled dynamic system."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3–4 — Fatigue Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Fatigue is